{"version":1,"key":"card:19","content":{"id":19,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明变量时，类型会被收缩为字面量类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const a = \"Hello\";","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"c21f83ec-49de-47a1-be71-706714e41a5b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5832e6b4-f629-4c95-9921-6c327e509eb4.png","uuid":"eddae061-48b9-42b8-9750-ebe585426ecc","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5832e6b4-f629-4c95-9921-6c327e509eb4.png"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"let","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明类型时，不会收缩为字面量类型，也比较合理，毕竟声明为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"let ","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"就表示可以继续被赋值，收缩为字面量没有意义。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"let a = \"Hello\";","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"9ab8ef6d-fde8-42a2-ae51-c05c253f4f59","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_57a2c827-1e4d-470d-b773-454925fecfc0.png","uuid":"ab348e07-82ea-418f-97f5-065cee260f52","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_57a2c827-1e4d-470d-b773-454925fecfc0.png"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当使用字面量作为对象某字段的初始值，该字段不会被收缩为字面量，无论对象使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"let","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"声明，这也是合理的，只是对象不能被重新赋值，但是对象的属性是可以被重新赋值的"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const obj = {\n  a: \"Hello\",\n}\nobj.a = \"World\";","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"0e88b78f-9356-4ddb-9bb8-b70851f91227","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_69ae7d74-d2af-4ff5-b73a-d60378eb0a33.png","uuid":"f20807d5-9202-4392-aa44-b631f7181365","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_69ae7d74-d2af-4ff5-b73a-d60378eb0a33.png"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是当我们对象赋值给具体类型的时候就会有错误了，如设置样式"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"function App() {\n const style = {\n     position: 'fixed',\n }\n  return (\n    <div style={style}>\n      Hello World!\n    </div>\n  )\n}\nexport default App","language":"TSX","uuid":"10cda12f-c0af-40a8-8ba1-7bbc4c263432","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_fafbfb38-9e11-4c33-a8c2-9d9240781465.png","uuid":"1ca1d26f-ad5b-473d-ad01-cb0f7d3ee8ba","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_fafbfb38-9e11-4c33-a8c2-9d9240781465.png"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里提示的是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不能赋值给 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Position | undefined","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Position","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的定义是"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"export type Position = Globals | \"-webkit-sticky\" | \"absolute\" | \"fixed\" | \"relative\" | \"static\" | \"sticky\";","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"4e4c5562-45a4-4434-bfdd-c4f8569c4266","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fixed","code":true},{"text":" 可以被赋值给 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Position","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是被由于判定为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型，所以不行，有两种办法："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"手动声明类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_74295b1d-6df0-4265-b660-a51ffea7c583.png","uuid":"686577a1-0af1-44a0-8833-83badb2f636a","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_74295b1d-6df0-4265-b660-a51ffea7c583.png"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"as const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，收缩为字面量类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e9c572b1-b28a-4888-92c9-11e6750c6581.png","uuid":"d479abce-a80c-4758-9c66-c7a7d747c5fd","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e9c572b1-b28a-4888-92c9-11e6750c6581.png"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"content-link","contentId":1652,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":617,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"satisfies","code":true}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，既可以验证类型，又可以推断出具体类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_db93722e-451d-4e3c-aecb-a6a8d3c42e3c.png","uuid":"5d1c98f5-6c9a-4b60-b22c-f6fdf9332544","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_db93722e-451d-4e3c-aecb-a6a8d3c42e3c.png"}]}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/技巧","技巧/TypeScript"],"createTime":168891389053